    "body": "\nCloses #40622\n\nCo-authored-by: TRAE CLI <trae-cli@users.noreply.github.com>\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-07T09:52:25Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40624#discussion_r3532733101"
                },
